      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9CC454E9FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "琵鲁做的超Z队队旗。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "74359C81505A76848D85005A961F961F65D730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在旅馆前打宝可梦对战，\n会让客人觉得这家旅馆很奇怪吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572865C59986524D62535B9D53EF68A65BF96218FF0C000A4F1A8BA95BA24EBA89C95F978FD95BB665C599865F885947602A54273002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "通过宝可梦对战释放自我吧。\n这就是所谓的了解彼此哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901A8FC75B9D53EF68A65BF9621891CA653E81EA621154273002000A8FD95C31662F62408C1376844E8689E35F7C6B6454E63002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为有宝可梦在身边，\n我才能更容易地和别人搭话……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n也就是说，\n宝可梦给了我认识世界的契机。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A67095B9D53EF68A657288EAB8FB9FF0C000A6211624D80FD66F45BB966135730548C522B4EBA642D8BDD2026202600100001BE01000A4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0C000A5B9D53EF68A67ED94E8662118BA48BC64E16754C76845951673A3002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只是生活在同一个城市里，\n并不能缩短宝可梦和人的距离。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA662F751F6D3B5728540C4E004E2A57CE5E0291CCFF0C000A5E764E0D80FD7F2977ED5B9D53EF68A6548C4EBA76848DDD79BB3002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷充满了令人惊奇的事物，\n而惊奇就是了解事物的第一步哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F751456EE14E864EE44EBA60CA594776844E8B7269FF0C000A800C60CA59475C31662F4E8689E34E8B726976847B2C4E006B6554E63002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果不能活用宝可梦的力量，\n就无法在ZA登峰战中获胜。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要怎样才能活用宝可梦的力量？\n那就是要了解宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4E0D80FD6D3B75285B9D53EF68A67684529B91CFFF0C000A5C3165E06CD55728005A0041767B5CF062184E2D83B780DC300200100001BE01000A8981600E6837624D80FD6D3B75285B9D53EF68A67684529B91CFFF1F000A90A35C31662F89814E8689E35B9D53EF68A63002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玛琪艾儿应该能够\n为你指出一条明路。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "739B742A827E513F5E948BE580FD591F000A4E3A4F60630751FA4E006761660E8DEF3002001000020114000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你问ZA登峰战∞吗？\n我会在享受的同时也注意睡足觉哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6095EE005A0041767B5CF06218221E5417FF1F000A62114F1A57284EAB53D77684540C65F64E5F6CE8610F77618DB389C954E63002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来发生塔失控这样的大事\n会连锁地引发其他事情啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B676553D1751F5854593163A78FD96837768459274E8B000A4F1A8FDE950157305F1553D151764ED64E8B60C5554A3002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "阔星的人们也真不容易啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n想必<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>会强行\n请他们吃可颂咖喱吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9614661F76844EBA4EEC4E5F771F4E0D5BB96613554A300200100001BE01000A60F35FC500100002018B00014F1A5F3A884C000A8BF74ED64EEC540353EF9882549655B154273002001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>总裁，\n你又在偷懒了，这真的好吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002018B0001603B88C1FF0C000A4F6053C85728507761D24E86FF0C8FD9771F7684597D5417FF1F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA登峰战∞啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我也经历了不少厉害的事情，\n要一路赢下去或许也不是梦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041767B5CF06218221E554A300200100001BE01000A62114E5F7ECF53864E864E0D5C1153895BB376844E8B60C5FF0C000A89814E008DEF8D624E0B53BB62168BB84E5F4E0D662F68A6FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那个故弄玄虚的大叔到底是何方神圣？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E2A65455F047384865A7684592753D452305E95662F4F5565B9795E5723FF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "即使<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>不在旅馆里，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā她他也是超Z队的队长！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53734F7F00100002018B00014E0D572865C5998691CCFF0C000A00100003110000FF010159794ED64E5F662F8D85005A961F7684961F957FFF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "琵鲁真是的，\n看来<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>在让他很开心啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "74359C81771F662F7684FF0C000A770B676500100002018B000157288BA94ED65F885F005FC3554A3002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在ZA登峰战∞中备受期待的，\n是我和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>你的再次对战哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728005A0041767B5CF06218221E4E2D590753D7671F5F857684FF0C000A662F6211548C00100002010000004F607684518D6B215BF9621854E6FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "参加ZA登峰战∞的时候，\n我的身份只是你的劲敌而已！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53C252A0005A0041767B5CF06218221E768465F65019FF0C000A621176848EAB4EFD53EA662F4F60768452B2654C800C5DF2FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我让自己装得像个总裁……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但要是没有大家在的话，\n一定无法迎来这样的未来吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662118BA981EA5DF188C55F9750CF4E2A603B88C12026202600100001BE01000A4F468981662F6CA1670959275BB6572876848BDDFF0C000A4E005B9A65E06CD58FCE67658FD968377684672A67655427300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我让自己装得像个总裁……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但要是没有大家在的话，\n一定无法迎来这样的未来吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662118BA981EA5DF188C55F9750CF4E2A603B88C12026202600100001BE01000A4F468981662F6CA1670959275BB6572876848BDDFF0C000A4E005B9A65E06CD58FCE67658FD968377684672A67655427300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由琵鲁制作的\n安馨儿的甜甜圈店的招牌。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "753174359C8152364F5C7684000A5B8999A8513F7684751C751C57085E97768462DB724C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "摆放着AZ收集的书籍。\n好像安馨儿也会时不时地拿来读。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
